$$

$$
\text{Overtime Earnings} = 5 \text{ hours} \times 12 \text{ dollars/hour} = 60 \text{ dollars}
$$

---

### Step 3: Total Weekly Earnings

Now, we add the regular earnings and the overtime earnings:

$$
\text{Total Earnings} = 400 + 60 = 460
$$

