Next, each omelet uses 3 eggs. So the total number of eggs she uses in 28 days would be 3 eggs/day × 28 days. Let me compute that. 3 × 28. Hmm, 3 times 20 is 60, and 3 times 8 is 24, so adding those together gives 60 + 24 = 84 eggs. So she uses 84 eggs in total over 4 weeks.

