Is there any chance that take care of their business is a different task that requires more time? But the problem says each dog takes 0.5 hours a day to walk and take care of their business. So that's the total time per dog per day. Therefore, the 0.5 hours already includes both walking and taking care of their business. So we don't need to split that. 

Therefore, my calculations seem right. 5 hours a day, 7 days a week is 35 hours. 

