Alternatively, think of it as the total she had after buying the package: 80 + x. Then she uses 220, so she has 80 + x - 220 = 23. Therefore, 80 + x = 23 + 220. So 80 + x = 243. Therefore, x = 243 - 80 = 163. Yep, same answer.

