Alternatively, maybe I should check with numbers. Suppose she bought 163. Then total is 80 + 163 = 243. Then she uses 220, so 243 - 220 = 23. Which is exactly what is said in the problem. So that works.

Therefore, the answer is 163. So the package had 163 Post-it notes.

