Next, we calculate the time it takes for Tok to travel back at the slower speed of 6 mph. Time is equal to distance divided by speed. The distance is still 30 miles, and the speed is 6 mph. Therefore, the time is 30 miles divided by 6 mph, which equals 5 hours.

