   $ 15 \text{ students} \times \$15/\text{student} = \$225 \text{ per class} $.

5. **Weekly Earnings**:  
   Total weekly earnings are:  
   $ 33 \text{ classes} \times \$225/\text{class} = \$7,425 $.

